{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52440","headline":"回波乐 八十三 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 八十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年（一作「牛」）老造新舍，鬼来拍手哭。\n身（一作「舍」）得蹔时坐，死後他人（一作「将」）卖。\n千年换百主，各自想还（一作「将回」）改。\n前死後人坐，本主何须（项校「相」，即「厢」）在。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}